mcrypt: the mcrypt functions (block ciphers and their modes) with
libmcrypt of the package az, bundled in PHP 5.6 (removed from PHP 7.2;
PECL mcrypt there).

The module mcrypt of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/mcrypt.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/mcrypt.
